Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.87,0:00:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a witch clad in white.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hers is a great power that will destroy everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It must never be awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.51,0:00:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of this witch was Velza...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.09,0:00:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[This summer, join Ed & Al on another adventure.]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All we need to do is stop her resurrection, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.73,0:00:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:01:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll do it right, Ed, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.43,0:01:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It might have some connection to the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[The girl who holds the key to salvation: Sophie]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.89,0:01:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[She must never be resurrected...]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.42,0:01:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[Even if it costs me my life.]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.99,0:01:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[Those trying to resurrect the witch: the Four Priests]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.45,0:01:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[Just a little longer...]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.81,0:01:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[Our goddess shall rise again!]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.85,0:01:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to face it all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.26,0:01:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We're friends, aren't we!?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.11,0:01:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.46,0:02:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[Alchemists...]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[Seal away...]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[...All evil!]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That child is our hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.89,0:02:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my father who gave me this mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.59,0:02:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,To fight against the Velza Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You must hurry on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the Prayer of the End!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.55,0:02:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We will never forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl who stood against fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.38,0:02:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and fought alongside us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.85,0:03:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,SOPHIE!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.65,0:03:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fullmetal Alchemist 3: The Girl Who Succeeds God
